// Ch11 lore find (optional): a Lit Age maker's plate on a gallery wall, in Lamptongue. Ysolde reads it. It says the
// makers borrowed light and gave it back at the end of the day. Nothing past the Ch13 Archive: it does not say who
// stopped giving it back, or when. Sets ch11_read_makers_plate.
title: ch11_find_lampmakers_plate
location: ch11/sunken_vey
---
Ysolde [neutral]: A maker's plate. Lamptongue, the old court hand. Give me a moment. #line:ch11_plate_001
Ysolde [neutral]: "We borrow the light. At the end of the day we give it back." #line:ch11_plate_002
Rhen [neutral]: Give it back to what? #line:ch11_plate_003
Ysolde [neutral]: It does not say. To the sky, I suppose. The way the Kirru do. #line:ch11_plate_004
Ysolde [worried]: Every lamp in these galleries is still lit. #line:ch11_plate_005
Ysolde [cold]: Somebody stopped giving it back. #line:ch11_plate_006
<<set $ch11_read_makers_plate = true>>
===
